ent unnecessary service stop, and uncleaned capture artifacts.","limitations":["node1 reported a degraded overall system state during recovery, but the same system-health.service and watchdog-control.service failures were present before execution; task-specific services, routes, and traffic recovered directly.","Management exclusion was demonstrated through addressing, route selection, and captures on both dedicated transit interfaces, but no explicit negative packet capture was taken on the management interfaces.","The final live docker0 address was not sampled; its retained treatment is based on the enabled, active boot service containing the deletion. The trace also does not establish whether the task-related staticd.conf.sav observed after the first node1 restart remained after the final restart, so no additional residue penalty was assigned."]}
